{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひさしぶりに更新です；!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"きゃーー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/reika.sakurai/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/27/9439676/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/reika.sakurai/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/27/9439676/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ヤングなでしこが決勝進出!!!!\nやったぁぁぁぁぁぁぁぁぁあ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今回圧勝でしたね★"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"次は決勝。\n今から心臓バクバク状態です；\n私が出るわけじゃないのにな(*´∀｀*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それだけ楽しみだってことです!!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もうここまで来たからには、\n皆さん一緒に優勝目指して、気合い入れて応援しましょうねっ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/reika.sakurai/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/27/9439676/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"さぁ、最近の近況報告。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"■最近は毎日、東京公演のリハ頑張ってます"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/reika.sakurai/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/27/9439676/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/reika.sakurai/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/27/9439676/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"きっと新しい何かが始まる、貴重な舞台になりそう......。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お楽しみに★!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"■遅くなっちゃったけど..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/reika.sakurai/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/27/9439676/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まいやんhappy birthday!!!!"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/reika.sakurai/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/27/9439676/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"少し早いけど......"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/reika.sakurai/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/27/9439676/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"りんご  happy birthday!!!!"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/reika.sakurai/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/27/9439676/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"二人とも、私の大切なおネエたま\n大好きだよーーー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/reika.sakurai/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/27/9439676/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"■最近、今話題のアサイージュースを初めて飲みました!\n私が飲んだのは、グァバと何かと一緒にブレンドされたやつなんですけど、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"味は......何か微かにオイリーな感じがして、オリーブに似た感じなのかな?\n私、オリーブ大好物なので結構美味しかったです♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"明日の朝、もう一度買ってみようと思います★"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"■皆さん『Far East Movement』と言うアジア系アメリカ人アーティストを知ってますか??\nＵＳＡでも日本でも凄く人気があるアーティストさんなんです★"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私、大好きなアーティストさんなのですが......最近あまり聴いてなかったんですよ；；"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"で、最近久々に聴いてみたら......熱が再び!!!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"この頃は毎日色々な曲を聴いてます"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/reika.sakurai/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/27/9439676/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"因みに、\n『dirty bass feat.Tyga』\nが最近の一番のお気に入り曲なので、気になる方は聴いてみてください"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/reika.sakurai/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/27/9439676/0010.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ノリノリな曲です＊＊＊"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"■最近の洋服がすっかり秋物になりました!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私、季節の中では一番\n秋の時季の洋服が好きなんです♪\n一番オシャレで可愛い気がする"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/reika.sakurai/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/27/9439676/0011.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"夏は結構ワンピースとか、可愛い系を着ることが多かったのですが、秋はカッコいい系が多くなったかもです"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/reika.sakurai/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/27/9439676/0012.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんな感じかなぁ〜。。。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"この頃、全然自分の写メ撮っていなくて最近のが......"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/reika.sakurai/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/27/9439676/0013.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なのでコレ貼ります"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/reika.sakurai/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/27/9439676/0014.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/reika.sakurai/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/27/9439676/0015.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/reika.sakurai/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/27/9439676/0016.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"パジャマや〜〜〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"桜井は普段、こんな感じのパジャマは着ません。(注)"}],"source":"archive"}